{"kind": "blogger#post", "id": "4912129754542397608", "blog": {"id": "489843540806914986"}, "published": "2025-07-13T20:14:00-07:00", "updated": "2025-11-05T07:22:30-08:00", "url": "https://www.cocosedu.co.kr/2025/07/blog-post_13.html", "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/blogger/v3/blogs/489843540806914986/posts/4912129754542397608", "title": "중등부 프로그램 소개", "content": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhLVDKfd7ZggV2Ulpsqqr99ZjWa67Pn9kKDYoqL_m6vhzQbgbWEe7aTI2Nl2znm_ErilZ8Dr8PBAzhhKWP01UY1d653TQb_LFYOFD2XsEAri6_YjP_Le62rSEi4KI0n7zqBqoCUPNJO3ZZbzwI96popQjhftsF-d8Pa3H4IQnsB0B8lIQRj9XaZEUBlcXMK/s1080/1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1080\" data-original-width=\"1080\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhLVDKfd7ZggV2Ulpsqqr99ZjWa67Pn9kKDYoqL_m6vhzQbgbWEe7aTI2Nl2znm_ErilZ8Dr8PBAzhhKWP01UY1d653TQb_LFYOFD2XsEAri6_YjP_Le62rSEi4KI0n7zqBqoCUPNJO3ZZbzwI96popQjhftsF-d8Pa3H4IQnsB0B8lIQRj9XaZEUBlcXMK/s16000/1.png\" /></a></div><br />&nbsp;<p></p><h2 data-end=\"130\" data-start=\"113\">🌟 중등부 프로그램 소개</h2>\n<h3 data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"132\">🔹 내신수업</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"144\">\n<li data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"144\">\n<p data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"146\">학교별 맞춤 커리큘럼 구성</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"173\" data-start=\"162\">🔹 정규수업</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"174\">\n<li data-end=\"183\" data-start=\"174\">\n<p data-end=\"183\" data-start=\"176\">Reading</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"193\" data-start=\"184\">\n<p data-end=\"193\" data-start=\"186\">Grammar</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"194\">\n<p data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"196\">Writing</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"205\">🔹 관리수업</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"217\">\n<li data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"217\">\n<p data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"219\">VOCA TEST</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"231\">\n<p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"233\">LC TEST</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"259\" data-start=\"243\">\n<p data-end=\"259\" data-start=\"245\">VOCA Writing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"260\">\n<p data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"262\">Writing TEST</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"277\">\n<p data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"279\">월말 평가</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"298\" data-start=\"286\">📅 수업 요일</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"331\" data-start=\"299\">\n<li data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"299\">\n<p data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"301\">정규 수업: 월/금, 화/목</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"331\" data-start=\"319\">\n<p data-end=\"331\" data-start=\"321\">특강 수업: 수/토</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"345\" data-start=\"333\">🎓 학년 구성</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"346\">\n<li data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"346\">\n<p data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"348\">예비중1 / 중1</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"366\" data-start=\"360\">\n<p data-end=\"366\" data-start=\"362\">중2</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"367\">\n<p data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"369\">중3</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"373\">⭐ 레벨 구성</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"421\" data-start=\"385\">\n<li data-end=\"397\" data-start=\"385\">\n<p data-end=\"397\" data-start=\"387\">SI (실력반)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"398\">\n<p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"400\">HI (기본반)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"421\" data-start=\"411\">\n<p data-end=\"421\" data-start=\"413\">UI (기초반)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>", "author": {"id": "04783440165843078075", "displayName": "리카수니", "url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04783440165843078075", "image": {"url": "//blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEij7m3uPaqJtF6qA_dfqRr4d9tEsZo_dlxVjEX1jRjybBZql7Kw8ry27dA0fV7SMK2ZO0doLsUCW3qnywwK9fBo6V4RG-xog5avEICcLozp6-6Y5S4EhVssm7E80YhbgdwrIS3tWvNg80AYkO_VySJW4znl3OOr7iDwg3X_7AeTpMViKg/s35/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%